      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there some value of `ALERT_STORM_INTERVAL` and `ALERT_STORM_MAX_COUNT` that will let the test pass?\n\nIf there is, then maybe we should adjust them, because if the test passes, then clearly we didn\u0027t watchdog. The maximum safe values might depend on the EC chip, though.",
