        "id": 1291180
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-28T02:55:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s no help if just stop the interrupts. Because ANX3447 need to clear alert status to clear FIFO, otherwize message will pending at FIFO to stop reply GoodCRC for the later BIST message.",
      "parentUuid": "db92e066_18cd046d",
      "revId": "3d71ad3dc69839850dc52f43d5d01de130cdbe47",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a6a6b6c3_295667d1",
